  "resume": "This is a 15-minute 1974 Swiss TV news report (Rundschau) covering the Greek parliamentary election campaign, juxtaposing scenes of traditional Greek life with political campaigning and the exile of former regime members on Kea. It features statements from political figures including Konstantinos Karamanlis and Alexandros Panagoulis."
